<title>USA: Smith Barney wins $300 mln Fla. Dept of Env. revs.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins $300 mln Fla. Dept of Env. revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it won $300 million of State of Florida Department of Environmental Protection Preservation 2000 revenue bonds, Series 1997A, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.37 percent.</p>
</text>
